** The form {{IPAchar|/ply/}} is obligatory (outside liaison) when modifying a following adjective/adverb (sense 1) and in the constructs {{m|fr||plus ..., plus ...}} (sense 2.1), and {{m|fr||ne ... plus}}, {{m|fr||non plus}} (sense 5).<!--It's not correct to say that it's always /ply/ when negated; cf. "il n'a pas plus /plys/ de pouvoir que le roi". The pronunciation depends on the construct, not on negation as such-->
